  "name": "Cream Stone Receipt",
  "description": "This receipt is issued by Cream Stone and identifies the transaction as a Take Away order. The header contains store branding, the operating entity, GST registration number, FSSAI licence number, bill number, transaction date and time, and cashier identification (Ranjith). The receipt includes an itemized purchase summary with quantity, unit rate, and line amount for each item. The financial section records the total merchandise value, CGST and SGST at 9% each, and the final grand total, followed by the total amount expressed in words. The footer contains customer contact information together with promotional messaging encouraging customer registration and feedback through the company's online platforms. The overall layout is representative of an Indian dessert retail POS receipt, combining GST-compliant tax reporting, food-business regulatory identification, takeaway order processing, and payment reconciliation within a compact retail receipt format.",
